{"overview":"وقتی یک مرد ۳۴ ساله که در رسیدن به اهدافش ناموفق بوده، با یک کامیون زیر گرفته می‌شود، داستانش به همین جا ختم نمی‌شود. رودی که در نوزادی در دنیایی جدید دوباره متولد شده، از هر فرصتی برای زندگی‌ای که همیشه آرزویش را داشته، استفاده می‌کند. او با دوستان جدید، توانایی‌های جادویی تازه کسب شده و شجاعت انجام کارهایی که همیشه آرزویش را داشته، در حال آغاز یک ماجراجویی حماسی است - با تمام تجربیات گذشته‌اش که دست نخورده باقی مانده است!","tagline":"","overview_en":"When a 34-year-old underachiever gets run over by a truck, his story doesn't end there. Reincarnated in a new world as an infant, Rudy will seize every opportunity to live the life he's always wanted. Armed with new friends, some freshly acquired magical abilities, and the courage to do the things he's always dreamed of, he's embarking on an epic adventure—with all of his past experience intact!","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":3,"y":2022,"poster":"/suYPdj3ygiNblzdlLQcc9LNPUVW.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":23,"y":2021,"poster":"/sviEqFIPJW5gFtuYy8XyE0Uscid.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":24,"y":2023,"poster":"/4QXhxdeA4ahGVIBlp7xRkIyzCTa.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":14,"y":2026,"poster":"/tn2mxPYSSUPHgfcAe5SCga1DO0i.jpg"}],"episodes":61,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"内山夕実","role":"Rudeus Greyrat (voice)","photo":"/JvavoF3YOLCf4LHfl4XvYobANE.jpg","en":"Yumi Uchiyama"},{"name":"杉田智和","role":"Rudeus Greyrat's Former Self (voice)","photo":"/cv5zuPZySNsHXu24pjKLYCRzJ2J.jpg","en":"Tomokazu Sugita"},{"name":"加隈亜衣","role":"Eris Boreas Greyrat (voice)","photo":"/o3tQSeeJAeafJNvQs2IKvpKY7av.jpg","en":"Ai Kakuma"},{"name":"茅野愛衣","role":"Sylphiette (voice)","photo":"/l8ywp387rfdAS7mOExe3cEZnsk0.jpg","en":"Ai Kayano"},{"name":"小原好美","role":"Roxy Migurdia (voice)","photo":"/3wjTzpJpBiTkLexdMmo9a3wfgRT.jpg","en":"Konomi Kohara"}],"trailer":"k5VxfJpzy1Q","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/94664/watch?loc